          "list": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A 10mm Pistol can accept one each of the following mods:</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Receiver: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.lZXmmJghkwx2Cfth]{Calibrated}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6BSZSiI20H86MtAb]{Hardened}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WCJ0QR5lOk9qBuxo]{Automatic}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.pNv4YuXn6LxkcLnj]{Hair Trigger}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.7EV6l9KqHJ6KJpQi]{Powerful}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.hXHvlCvphIQ8x4be]{Advanced}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Barrel:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6py6TtlkeywhWQl1]{Long Barrel}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.cvoae6Grdf6NGVM4]{Ported Barrel}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Grip:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.PFcI423I5SKnvL0M]{Comfort Grip}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.oFXs4w5msufzhIVI]{Sharpshooter's Grip}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Magazine:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.COx7kAmBX5tY55ty]{Large Magazine}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.lcYV8De9jKX8legK]{Quick-Eject Magazine}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.eTh6sOdMe4xVwPOj]{Large Quick-Eject Magazine}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Sights:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WZAnlfreDNUAaX4Y]{Reflex Sight}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.K8ZOSxg9heUurjsM]{Recon Scope}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Muzzle:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.yc9XrK9oHlAwskcS]{Compensator}<